  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 507.55 English Language Arts Teacher For Grades 5-8. A candidate for certification as an English language arts teacher for grades 5-8 shall have the skills, competencies and knowledge, gained through a combination of academic and supervised practical experience, as outlined in Ed 507.24(c).\n\nSource. #12417, eff 11-14-17 (formerly Ed 507.241); renumbered by #12603 (formerly Ed 507.53)",
